# Ignore all the files
*
#
# Machine-local / generated (under this repo as `user-emacs-directory'):
#   custom.el, elpa/, rime/, var/, .local/, tree-sitter/, transient/, auto-save-list/
# are NOT whitelisted below → stay untracked by default.
# Managed source lives under !lisp/ etc. (org-html-themes 已纳入 lisp/writing/org/org-html-themes/)

# Excludes - only control these files
!.gitignore
!README*.md
!init.el
!early-init.el
!lisp/
!lisp/**
!lisp/**/**

# 文档（按需白名单 specs / jobs，避免 `*` 把整个 `docs/` 挡在版本库外）
!docs/
!docs/specs/
!docs/specs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/jobs/
!docs/jobs/README.md
!docs/jobs/emacs-align-doom-patterns.md

# Emacs byte-compiled artifacts are machine/version-local generated files.
*.elc
**/*.elc

.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Machine-local profile overlay (optional):
profile-*.el
